@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-local-access-token
@businessId = 1

### Scoped discovery; missing settings must return false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}

### Missing Business for an unscoped administrator must return 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid Business header must return 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: 0
